    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1730300488673\" id=\"item-67224688d9967d682e40db4f\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-73ffdfec5187d5c345cf\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us:</strong> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Property Media Japan specializes in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floorplans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bedrooms:</strong> Three cozy bedrooms, each offering privacy and serene views, ideal for relaxation and rest.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bathrooms:</strong> A modern, well-appointed bathroom featuring sleek finishes and a spacious layout, ensuring a spa-like experience every day.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Living Rooms:</strong> Two expansive living areas, designed for entertainment and leisure, with ample natural light and refined decor.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Kitchen:</strong> A state-of-the-art kitchen with high-end appliances and stylish cabinetry, coupled with a spacious dining area perfect for family meals and gatherings.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Garage:</strong> A convenient single-car garage with additional space for storage.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Outdoor Living:</strong> Enjoy the landscaped garden and outdoor seating area, perfect for relaxing and enjoying the peaceful surroundings in New Zealand</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Located in a prestigious neighborhood, this home is not just a place to live but a haven for those who appreciate elegance and tranquility. Whether you are looking for a family home or a luxurious retreat, Gemscott Cres Huapai offers an unparalleled living experience.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspect-ratio&quot;:&quot;square&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;672248716a66bc07de87397e&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;lightbox&quot;:false,&quot;padding&quot;:20,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;thumbnails-per-row&quot;:4,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;672248716a66bc07de87397e&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1730258888192_518965\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"672248766a01212e47d5d015\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \n              <noscript><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32